---
title: Request to book, then accept, decline or expiry
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor G as Guest
    participant A as Django API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant J as Celery beat + worker
    actor H as Host manager
    G->>A: POST /bookings (listing in request mode)
    A->>DB: INSERT booking pending, expires in 24 h
    Note over DB: dates stay blocked while pending
    A-->>G: 201 pending
    A-)H: notification and SMS (via outbox)
    alt host accepts in time
        H->>A: POST /host/bookings/{id}/accept
        A->>DB: check permission and wallet above floor
        A->>DB: status confirmed, post commission
        A-)G: confirmed notification
    else host declines
        H->>A: POST /host/bookings/{id}/decline with reason
        A->>DB: status declined, dates released
        A-)G: declined notification
    else nobody answers
        J->>DB: every 5 min, find pending past deadline
        J->>DB: status expired, dates released
        J-)G: expired notification
        J-)H: missed request notification
    end
